**Differential Equations for Products**

In the following \(\vartheta\!=\!z\frac{d}{dz}\) and \(\mathscr{C}_{r}(z)\), \(\mathscr{D}_{r}(z)\) are any cylinder functions of orders \(r\), \(\mu\) respectively.

9.1.57 \(\{\vartheta^{4}\!-\!2(v^{2}\!+\!u^{2})\vartheta^{2}\!+\!(v^{2}\!-\!u^{2})^{2}\}w\)

\(+4z^{2}(\vartheta\!+\!1)(\vartheta\!+\!2)w\!=\!0,\quad w\!=\!\mathscr{C}_{r}(z)\!\!